#: ../../../interop/dbus-vnc.rst:2
msgid "D-Bus VNC"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/dbus-vnc.rst:4
msgid ""
"The ``qemu-vnc`` standalone VNC server exposes a D-Bus interface for "
"management and monitoring of VNC connections."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../interop/dbus-vnc.rst:7
msgid ""
"The service is available on the bus under the well-known name ``org.qemu."
"vnc``. Objects are exported under ``/org/qemu/Vnc1/``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../tools/qemu-vnc/qemu-vnc1.xml:1
msgid ""
"This interface is implemented on ``/org/qemu/Vnc1/Server``. It provides "
"management and monitoring of the VNC server."
msgstr ""

